## 5. Rutas GFS (lab `192.168.137.190`)

| Ruta | Uso |
|------|-----|
| `/gfssterling/jar/5.0.0/` | JAR versionado |
| `/gfssterling/jar/app.conf` | `FileJar`, `JARPATH`, Netty |
| `/gfssterling/jar/app.5.4.0.sh` | Wrapper producción |
| `/gfssterling/jar/mail_list` | correo → `.enc` |
| `/gfssterling/jar/mail-attachment/<WFID>/` | Salida + `ListF.xml` |
| `/gfssterling/cipher/` | CipherConsole, `*.enc` |
| `/gfssterling/jar/certs/` | Certs (repo: `artifact/jar/certs/`) |
| `/gfssterling/java/temurin-jre-17.0.13/` | JRE |

**Paridad repo:** `artifact/jar/` ↔ `/gfssterling/jar/`. Tras cambiar versión en `pom.xml`, actualizar `artifact/jar/app.conf` → `FileJar=O365InboxAttachmentToDisk-<version>.jar`.

